<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="row mt-4 mb-5">
    <div class="col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-8 offset-lg-2">
        <div class="card shadow-sm p-4 border-0 rounded-4">
            <h1 class="h2 mb-4 fw-bold text-dark"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-danger me-2"></i>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="text-muted">Last updated: September 2026</p>
            <hr class="my-3"/>
            
            <h4 class="h5 fw-semibold mt-3">1. Information We Collect</h4>
            <p class="text-secondary">When you register or browse on Wanderlust, we collect details such as your username, email address, listings you post, and reviews you submit. This helps us ensure a secure and trusted community for hosts and travelers.</p>

            <h4 class="h5 fw-semibold mt-3">2. How We Use Your Information</h4>
            <p class="text-secondary">We use collected information to manage your user account, display listings with approximate map locations, notify you of bookings or reviews, and protect against fraudulent activity.</p>

            <h4 class="h5 fw-semibold mt-3">3. Location and Maps Data</h4>
            <p class="text-secondary">We use Mapbox geocoding services to display approximate location pins. Your exact house address is kept private and shared only after a confirmed reservation.</p>

            <h4 class="h5 fw-semibold mt-3">4. Cookies and Security</h4>
            <p class="text-secondary">We use secure session cookies to keep you signed in securely. We do not sell your personal information to third-party advertisers.</p>

            <div class="mt-4">
                <a href="/listings" class="btn btn-outline-dark rounded-pill px-4"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left me-2"></i>Back to Listings</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
